  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Network activity DSU/JSA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DSU would like to invite our partners in Juventud Socialista de Argentina to our general assembly in order to structure our pilot project which we plan to apply for shortly after the sending of this application. While in Denmark, DSU will also show the members from JS our own local, national, and European structure to provide a comparison for JS to build up their own organisation with. Lastly, we hope that JS meeting DSUs volunteers can both concretize to JS how our two organisations can work together, and to help generate excitement among DSUs volunteers, some of whom the South America Group will then try to recruit for future stages of the cooperation.</narrative>
  </description>
